               (implies (equal (fn-blake3 (fn2-fc-covered 0 bytes a)) (fn-blake3 (fn2-fc-covered 0 bytes b)))
                        (fn2-a-integrity-evidence (fn2-fc-covered 0 bytes a) (fn2-fc-covered 0 bytes b))))
          (not (fn2-fc-acceptedp 0 bytes b)))
 :teeth "Unit book evaluates actual accepted frame, different-location refusal, and same-location counterexample after removing distinct identity. Hash-equality integrity premise is explicit."
 :doc "Actual step/once checker via its pool adapter. Allocation identity includes extent epoch and counter; physical frame location is independent of extent. Unproved.")
